Error [E0317]: Or-pattern alternatives bind different names or types
  --> tests/ui/pattern_inconsistent_binding.jet:13:9
    |
 13 |         .Net.Ping(n) | .Net.Name(n) -> "net {n}"
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every arm of `A(x) | B(y)` must bind the same names at the same types
 Fix: Rename bindings so both alternatives bind identical names
